LAME 3.100 (https://lame.sourceforge.io), the MP3 encoder used by Ikaros
Studio's MP3 export. LGPL 2 or later: see COPYING and LICENSE.

From the official release lame-3.100.tar.gz on SourceForge
(md5 83e260acbe4389b54fe08e0bdbf7cddb, sha256
ddfe36cab873794038ae2c1210557ad34857a4b6bdc515785d1da9e175b1da1e).
Only the encoder library is kept: libmp3lame/ (without mpglib_interface.c,
the i386/ and vector/ SIMD code except vector/lame_intrin.h, which fft.c
includes, and the makefiles) and include/lame.h. The
files are unchanged. ikaros/ holds our CMake build and config.h.
